{"song_id": 150409, "title": "Monster Zero", "language": "en", "lyricists": [70], "lyrics": [{"section_id": "section_0", "type": "planet", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "The monster again, Zero!", "rhyme": "o"}], "rhyme": "A", "rhyme_vowel": "A"}, {"section_id": "section_1", "type": "controller", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Monster Zero, command all units to take defensive position", "rhyme": "$"}], "rhyme": "A", "rhyme_vowel": "A"}, {"section_id": "section_2", "type": "planet", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Yessir!", "rhyme": "iR"}], "rhyme": "A", "rhyme_vowel": "A"}, {"section_id": "section_3", "type": "k.", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "What is Monster Zero?", "rhyme": "o"}], "rhyme": "A", "rhyme_vowel": "A"}, {"section_id": "section_4", "type": "controller", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Monster Zero is the reason we cannot live on the surface", "rhyme": "as"}, {"n": "1", "text": "But must forever live underground, like this", "rhyme": "i"}], "rhyme": "AB", "rhyme_vowel": "AB"}, {"section_id": "section_5", "type": "k.", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Oh, right", "rhyme": "ajt"}], "rhyme": "A", "rhyme_vowel": "A"}, {"section_id": "section_6", "type": "controller", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "I will show you... Monster Zero", "rhyme": "o"}], "rhyme": "A", "rhyme_vowel": "A"}, {"section_id": "section_7", "type": "k.", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Hey, look!", "rhyme": "uk"}], "rhyme": "A", "rhyme_vowel": "A"}, {"section_id": "section_8", "type": "glen", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "It's King Geedorah!", "rhyme": "a"}], "rhyme": "A", "rhyme_vowel": "A"}, {"section_id": "section_9", "type": "controller", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Yes, indeed. On Earth, you gave this terrifying monster the name of \"Geedorah\"", "rhyme": "a"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Everything is numbered here; the monster is Zero. (King Geedorah roars)", "rhyme": "o"}], "rhyme": "AB", "rhyme_vowel": "AB"}, {"section_id": "section_10", "type": "woman", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Pay heed to my warning, the entire Human race will perish from the Earth", "rhyme": "at"}, {"n": "1", "text": "When the monster, Geedorah passes, only flaming ruins are left", "rhyme": "aft"}], "rhyme": "AB", "rhyme_vowel": "AA"}, {"section_id": "section_11", "type": "man", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Geedorah, of course, that's why she had the pistol", "rhyme": "Ol"}], "rhyme": "A", "rhyme_vowel": "A"}, {"section_id": "section_12", "type": "woman", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "What pistol?", "rhyme": "Ol"}], "rhyme": "A", "rhyme_vowel": "A"}, {"section_id": "section_13", "type": "man", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "I - When I first met her, she was carrying a pistol in her purse", "rhyme": "uRs"}, {"n": "1", "text": "I asked her about it and she explained to me, and I believed her", "rhyme": "e"}], "rhyme": "AB", "rhyme_vowel": "AB"}, {"section_id": "section_14", "type": "planet", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "And now you're convinced that we're from outer space?", "rhyme": "as"}], "rhyme": "A", "rhyme_vowel": "A"}, {"section_id": "section_15", "type": "glen", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "That's right. What do you have on your mind?", "rhyme": "#"}], "rhyme": "A", "rhyme_vowel": "A"}, {"section_id": "section_16", "type": "planet", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Peace terms", "rhyme": "Om"}], "rhyme": "A", "rhyme_vowel": "A"}, {"section_id": "section_17", "type": "glen", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Peace terms?", "rhyme": "Om"}], "rhyme": "A", "rhyme_vowel": "A"}, {"section_id": "section_18", "type": "woman", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "A nice idea", "rhyme": "a"}], "rhyme": "A", "rhyme_vowel": "A"}, {"section_id": "section_19", "type": "man", "performer":