fish and works in isolation", "rhyme": "$"}, {"n": "5", "text": "A killer who may have used off hours in a laboratory to produce-", "rhyme": "e"}], "rhyme": "ABCDEF", "rhyme_vowel": "ABCADE"}, {"section_id": "section_28", "type": "man", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Music, brother!", "rhyme": "ER"}], "rhyme": "A", "rhyme_vowel": "A"}, {"section_id": "section_29", "type": "man", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "You call that music?", "rhyme": "ik"}], "rhyme": "A", "rhyme_vowel": "A"}, {"section_id": "section_30", "type": "man", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Yeah", "rhyme": "E"}], "rhyme": "A", "rhyme_vowel": "A"}, {"section_id": "section_31", "type": "man", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "By the grace of Almighty, it sounds like god damn jungle warfare, I'll tell ya. Now let me get this straight, you stand out here selling-", "rhyme": "iN"}], "rhyme": "A", "rhyme_vowel": "A"}, {"section_id": "section_32", "type": "peter", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Trees. That just what they are: trees", "rhyme": "e"}], "rhyme": "A", "rhyme_vowel": "A"}, {"section_id": "section_33", "type": "william", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Where'd you find this?", "rhyme": "i"}], "rhyme": "A", "rhyme_vowel": "A"}, {"section_id": "section_34", "type": "peter", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "I told you, I've been looking around", "rhyme": "awnd"}], "rhyme": "A", "rhyme_vowel": "A"}, {"section_id": "section_35", "type": "william", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Where?", "rhyme": "eR"}], "rhyme": "A", "rhyme_vowel": "A"}, {"section_id": "section_36", "type": "peter", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "I was gonna show it to you. As a matter of fact, I've been testing it. I just found out it was pure a little bit ago", "rhyme": "o"}], "rhyme": "A", "rhyme_vowel": "A"}, {"section_id": "section_37", "type": "william", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "t